  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your unleash a frozen torrent at your foes.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Marid Coldsnap<sup>UC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You add your mythic tier to the damage dealt by your Marid Coldsnap, and the ground in the area of Marid Coldsnap becomes as difficult to traverse as the area of a grease spell, and any creature falling prone within the affected line takes cold damage equal to one-half your mythic tier. Any creature entering or remaining within that area takes cold damage equal to one-half your mythic tier. Creatures damaged by your Marid Coldsnap become entangled (and fatigued, if non-mythic) for 1d4 rounds on a failed Fortitude save against the same DC as the feat’s Reflex save DC.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-style-feats#toc19\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
